## Usage Pattern

```
User Request
    ↓ (auto-discovered)
Load AGENTS.md
    ↓
Evaluate triggers (session start)
    ↓
Load relevant skill(s) from ./skills/
    ↓
Load relevant things from ./things/
    ↓
Execute with consistency checks
    ↓
Validate changes
    ↓
Commit with structured message
    ↓
Evaluate triggers (post-write)
    ↓
Report changes
```

## Validation Checklist

Before committing, verify:

- [ ] Relevant skill loaded for this operation
- [ ] thing.md structure followed (id, type, status, created present)
- [ ] Domain principles maintained
- [ ] Changes scoped to appropriate things
- [ ] linked_things references are valid (targets exist)
- [ ] Commit message follows `action: description` convention
